3. NumPy
   Purpose: numerical arrays for optional ONNX-backed tagger and quality
   runtimes.
   License: BSD 3-Clause.
   Project: https://numpy.org/

4. ONNX Runtime
   Purpose: inference runtime for optional WD14, JoyTag, and YOLOX quality
